## Title: Are You Slow?
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 1.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 2
## APIVersion: 101051
## SavedVariables: AreYouSlowSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20200
## Description: Shows your current movement speed on screen, either as a smoothed number or as a 30 second bar graph. Choose which in the Add-Ons settings menu.

; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; MANIFEST NOTES
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; AddOnVersion is an integer that must only ever INCREASE, and it steps by one
; per PUBLISHED build regardless of how far the semantic Version jumps. It is
; what the console catalogue uses; Version is only ever shown to humans.
; 1.0.0 shipped as AddOnVersion 1, so 1.1.0 is 2.
;
; .addon only, no .txt: console-only addon, and the console client has
; ignored .txt manifests since June 2025.
;
; PlayStation's filesystem is case-sensitive. Every path listed below, and the
; folder and manifest names themselves, must match the real files exactly.
;
; Description must stay ONE line and should match the Bethesda.net listing.
;
; DependsOn (hard), not OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings is on the
; Bethesda.net console catalogue, so a hard dependency resolves and
; auto-installs. The minimum is pinned to the library's LATEST release
; (2.2.0 = 20200, still current on ESOUI as of 2026-10-05) per ESOUI best
; practice; raise it whenever LHAS updates. On Bethesda.net the dependency is
; attached to the add-on entry without choosing a release.
;
; APIVersion tracks the live game. 101051 = Update 51, live 2026-09-28.
; PTS reported the same number on 2026-10-05, so there is nothing to add.
;
; File order: the XML declares virtuals that the Lua instantiates at
; EVENT_ADD_ON_LOADED, and the XML has no OnInitialized handlers, so the order
; is not load-bearing. XML first is the conventional lookup direction.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

